  "translationRepairs": [
    ["s0181","idiomatic","The section on ecliptic lodge passage was supplemented by Wu Ze and others of the Astronomical Bureau; the versions of Wu Shiju of Kaifeng, Cheng Xi of the National University, and Zhang Wenjin of Changzhou all lack it.","The ecliptic lodge-passage section was supplemented and corrected by Wu Ze and others of the Astronomical Bureau; the versions of Wu Shiju, Presented Scholar of Kaifeng, Cheng Xi, Presented Scholar of the National University, and Zhang Wenjin, commoner of Changzhou, all lack it.","補治 requires both supplement and correct, and 開封進士、國學進士、常州百姓 mark credential/status, not bare place-of phrases; the proposed wording restores those senses without inventing content.","medium","applied"],
    ["s0281","idiomatic","At conjunction, if it is not a true crossing, the sun lies on the ecliptic and the moon on the nine paths at the lodges entered—though the amounts differ.","At conjunction, if it is not a true crossing, the sun lies on the ecliptic and the moon on the nine paths at the lodges entered.","s0281 ends at 所入宿度; 雖多少不同 opens s0282, so the fused clause “though the amounts differ” does not belong in this unit.","high","applied"],
    ["s0281","literal","Whenever at conjunction, if it is not a true crossing, the sun is on the Yellow Path and the moon on the nine paths, at the lodges entered—though the amounts differ.","Whenever at conjunction, if it is not a true crossing, the sun is on the Yellow Path and the moon on the nine paths, at the lodges entered.","The Chinese unit stops at 所入宿度; 雖多少不同 is the start of s0282, so removing the fused clause from the literal is required.","high","applied"]
  ],
